---
// src/components/Header.astro
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// The pink banner at the top of every page.
//
// This replaces Hugo's layouts/partials/header.html. The original
// had all its styling crammed into style="..." attributes; those
// now live in src/styles/global.css under ".site-header", which
// means you can restyle the banner without touching this file.
//
// Note: the Hugo homepage said "HOME. OF. NUTS." while every other
// page said "HELLA. BIG. TRUCK. NUTS." — there was no reason for the
// difference, so now it's one banner everywhere. If you want the
// homepage to differ again, pass a prop (see BaseLayout for how).
// ------------------------------------------------------------
---

<header class="site-header">
  <a href="/">HELLA. BIG. TRUCK. NUTS.</a>
</header>
